{"overview":"کگومه هیگوراشی، دختری جوان در دوران معاصر است که با خانواده‌اش در کنار معبد قدیمی هیگوراشی زندگی می‌کند. او نمی‌داند که او تجسد دوباره‌ی کشیشی به نام کیکیو است و «جواهر چهار روح» (جواهر شیكون) را در خود دارد. در یک روز سرنوشت‌ساز، کگومه یک چاه باستانی نزدیک خانه‌اش پیدا می‌کند و ناگهان از طریق آن چاه به ژاپن فئودالی منتقل می‌شود، جایی که شیطان‌ها ساکن هستند. در آنجا، او با اینویاشا، پسر یک پدر شیطانی قدرتمند و مادر انسانی، که توسط یک تیر جادویی به درختی چسبیده است، روبه‌رو می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kagome Higurashi is a modern day young girl who lives with her family by the old Higure shrine. Unbeknownst to Kagome, she is the reincarnation of priestess Kikyo and posseses the \"Jewel of Four Souls\" (the Shikon jewel). One ill-fated day, Kagome locates an ancient well near her home and is abruptly transported through the well and into a feudal Japan, inhabited by demons. There, she encounters Inuyasha, son of a powerful demon father and a human mother, who is pinned to a tree by an enchanted arrow.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2008,"poster":"/eG5nbZwjt5KjILk20QRA2FkVK2B.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":167,"y":2000,"poster":"/oeYtGuEuKCF0etdR8ggaoZb1pO7.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":26,"y":2009,"poster":"/jwztG6rlwiQCfOqhigySZqoIjGF.jpg"}],"episodes":193,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山口勝平","role":"InuYasha (voice)","photo":"/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg","en":"Kappei Yamaguchi"},{"name":"ゆきのさつき","role":"Kagome Higurashi (voice)","photo":"/fb9LqdOZPNjlXq3uHriBOmIe2WP.jpg","en":"Satsuki Yukino"},{"name":"辻谷耕史","role":"Miroku (voice)","photo":"/7NTqy1dhJUNYjMAFqB5j1lNaar.jpg","en":"Koji Tsujitani"},{"name":"桑島法子","role":"Sango (voice)","photo":"/uZSmoh5jSdLwmkLaCnC3Xju6TTN.jpg","en":"Houko Kuwashima"},{"name":"成田剣","role":"Sesshomaru (voice)","photo":"/7fuRQk5eUp0MWQxxkw15RM1KxQM.jpg","en":"Ken Narita"},{"name":"能登麻美子","role":"Rin (voice)","photo":"